### Collection GET
GET http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: fr-FR,fr;q=0.9,en;q=0.8
# Anglais (priorité) Accept-Language: en-US,en;q=0.9,fr;q=0.8,es;q=0.7
# Espagnol (priorité) Accept-Language: es-ES,es;q=0.9,en-US;q=0.8,fr;q=0.7
# Polonais (priorité) Accept-Language: pl-PL,pl;q=0.9,en;q=0.8,fr;q=0.7
Accept: application/json

### Collection POST
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Livre",
  "date_of_publication": "2023-12-23",
  "synopsis": "Un très bon livre",
  "author_id": 2,
  "category_id": 3
}

### Item GET
GET http://localhost:3000/books/21
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: fr-FR,fr;q=0.9,en;q=0.8
Accept: application/json

### Item PATCH 
PATCH http://localhost:3000/books/15
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/xml

{
  "synopsis": "Synopsis mis à jour"
}

### Item DELETE
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/-1
